  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></msup></mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi></msup></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math> is equal to :"
  },
